1
00:00:00,215 --> 00:00:03,580
When you walk through a storm ♪ 当你穿过风暴时 ♪

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:09,710
Hold your head up high ♪ 抬起你的头颅 ♪

3
00:00:09,710 --> 00:00:19,625
And don't be afraid of the dark ♪ 不要害怕黑暗 ♪

4
00:00:21,895 --> 00:00:28,240
At the end of a storm ♪ 在风暴的尽头 ♪

5
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:34,930
There's a golden sky ♪ 有一片金色的天空 ♪

6
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:45,450
And the sweet silver song of a lark ♪ 还有云雀甜美的银歌声 ♪

7
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:53,500
Walk on through the wind ♪ 在风中继续前行 ♪

8
00:00:53,750 --> 00:01:00,230
Walk on through the rain ♪ 在雨中继续前行 ♪

9
00:01:00,230 --> 00:01:12,890
Though your dreams be tossed and blown ♪ 哪怕梦想被风雨打落吹散 ♪

10
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:15,395
Walk on ♪ 继续前行 ♪

11
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:19,330
Walk on ♪ 继续前行 ♪

12
00:01:19,330 --> 00:01:25,990
With hope in your heart ♪ 心中怀有希望 ♪

13
00:01:25,990 --> 00:01:35,030
And you'll never walk alone ♪ 你永远不会独行 ♪

